en in the background. The application can be minimized at any time and is designed to work without affecting game performance or modifying game files. \n\n• \nPractice while your favorite game is running.\n\n• \nWorks with games using Full Screen Windowed mode.\n\n• \nCan be minimized instantly by pressing Esc.\n\n• \nDoes not impact game performance.\n\n• \nDoes not record player data.\n\n• \nDoes not modify game configuration files.\n\nLaunch C-4 and then your favorite game;\n\n• \n(favorite game should be in \"Full Screen Windowed\" mode)\n\nEnable \"Play Audio When Game In Background\" in your favorite game;\n\n• \n(enable developer console and type snd_mute_losefocus #)\n\nIncrease the background FPS limit of your favorite game;\n\n• \n(enable developer console and type  engine_no_focus_sleep 0)\n\nC-4 has no impact on the players' performance, nor record data or tamper with game settings files.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305350/header.jpg?t=1784074195"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784074195"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305350/extras/34ca86a4c7f195da6befb88c1983d348.avif?t=1784074195","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305350/extras/81265c3e3d08832cf39b7b70ee0010fe.avif?t=1784074195","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305350/ss_4fea769709efd9f70633e258d6c8ae7f4849af94.600x338.jpg?t=1784074195","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305350/ss_4fea769709efd9f70633e258d6c8ae7f4849af94.1920x1080